<div class="c"><h1 class="redstar">Poetry By:Nena</h1></div><h2 class="c">My Black Angel</h2><p>In a wooden char beside my window.<br>  I watch the pouring rain.<br>  I talk to shadows from a lonley candle.<br>  I can´t explain .... this pain.<br>  the walls will tell the story of my pain.<br>  Waiting for my black angel to ease my pain.<br>  He is the one that can ease my sorrow <br>  my love for him will help me find my way.<br>  my Black angel,<br>  always in the dark when light is what you need.<br></p><hr width="50%" class="redstar"></body>
